    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "うぅ～、カフェの新商品が\r\nこンたら苦～いコーヒーだったなンて……。",
            "enText": "Ugh… I didn't think the cafe's new drink\nwas gonna be <i>this</i> bitter…",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4304212263683546864,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "この香り……なるほど……\r\nエスプレッソですね。",
            "enText": "That aroma… Ah, yes… That's an espresso.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3375560451704411113,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……スプーン2、3杯のグラニュー糖を\r\n足せば、苦みは和らぎます。",
            "enText": "…You can add two to three spoons of sugar\nto it to make it taste milder.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -2500506313051014688,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "え！　け、けンど……お砂糖を入れンのは、\r\nイケてないような……。",
            "enText": "Wha? B-But… wouldn't add'n sugar\nmake me look like a big dweeb?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -2145690464940888317,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……コーヒーは嗜好品。\r\n……飲み方はユキノさんの自由です。",
            "enText": "…Coffee is an indulgence. It's meant to be\ndrunk in whatever way you want.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 3396664937110126544,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "あたしの……自由……。\r\nでも、そンなら……！！",
            "enText": "The way I want? Well, in that case…!!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 1190114641856404785,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "やっぱりあたし、苦いまンま飲んでみます！\r\n“シチーガール”の仲間入り、したいンで！",
            "enText": "I wanna try and drink it bitter!\n'Cause that's what a city girl would do!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -3094820329391956671,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……本場のイタリアでは、砂糖を入れて\r\n飲むのが“都会流”……だそうですよ。",
            "enText": "…In Italy, where espresso comes from,\nadding sugar is called drinking it\n\"city style\"… apparently.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 1690886750015890256,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "えぇぇ！　“都会流”……！？\r\nえっと、ええっと、そンなら――？",
            "enText": "Really?! \"City style\", you say?!\nUm, well, in that case…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 4272238697269665900,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "……お砂糖、入れたいです～。",
            "enText": "I'll just add… a lil' sugar.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -6780041743097178049,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780170603,
    "humanTl": true
}